mcp_integration.configuration:
MCP 服务器在配置文件中定义：
```jsonc
{
  "mcp": {
    "github": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],
      "environment": { "GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN": "..." }
    },
    "slack": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-slack"]
    }
  }
}
```

mcp_integration.naming_convention:
MCP 工具命名格式：{server}_{tool}
示例：github_search_repositories, slack_send_message
不要在参数中包含 server 前缀，前缀仅用于标识来源。
